# Tabs and favorites: a new tab, moving between tabs, and a folder added to Favorites.
Output assets/readme/feature-tabs.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape
Type "lazyfinder" Enter
Wait+Screen@20s /Favorites/
Show
Sleep 1s

Ctrl+T
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "{"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "}"
Sleep 1.2s
Backspace
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Type "b"
Sleep 2s
Type "E"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 800ms

Type "q"
